{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act22side_level_act22side_st03",
  "groupId": "act22side",
  "stageId": "act22side_st03",
  "title": "一聲嗚咽",
  "storyCode": "FC-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c8235bc25533ca102a8597d99692f128234363688c9178e3b49e25bf54bb84ad",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g11_hispdwarshipdeck"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電台通訊聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前方小雨天氣，航道已確認，沿途偵測站將默認放行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電台通訊聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收到道森子爵的電報，對方希望借此次放行的契機，與深池代表會面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又是一些倒向我們的貴族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧，領袖不打算對他們有什麼表示。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是簡單示好就想獲得深池的和平保證，控制住領地內塔拉人的激昂情緒，是不是有點太吝嗇了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們遲早要學會，怎麼付出代價才算誠意十足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "領袖依然派你去交涉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許我更需要花一段時間，讓大家先忘記我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是個好消息。以我的標準，你失誤的行動不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵......既然你獨自登艦彙報，看來，你還是沒抓到拉芙希妮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不必明知故問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你阻攔了我的隊伍繼續搜捕，事後又把她去過的地點暗示給我的士兵，這種搭救方式於你而言，算不上高明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你又怎麼知道，我搭救的不是你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得，領袖從來沒有說過自己想處死她吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "領袖允許她肆意逃竄，也同樣允許我自行判斷，要如何對待她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要怪我對你的熟人太過苛刻，阿赫茉妮。沒人能放任一條德拉克在眼下的維多利亞隨意行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別在意，我想我和她的關係也沒有那麼好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你瞧，我正打算去她此前藏身的那家醫療公司看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，也說不定，先抓到她的人是我呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......喂，等等，航道上有建築物？能見度太低，發現得太晚了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一帶的航道規劃是誰完成的？前天的勘測組是哪一組？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在全艦隊偏轉方向已經來不及了，優先確認建築內有無人員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。磚木結構房屋，體積很小，不會對戰艦履帶造成任何威脅。按照原定航道繼續行駛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊，又是一個小小的失誤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戰爭總要忍受一些犧牲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白你的意思。但是，我也有我的“自行判斷”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓拉芙希妮犧牲？代價恐怕太大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟，那可是流著德拉克之血的戰士，就算感染了礦石病，也還是很有用呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g6_noblelivingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我沒有將她帶回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她沒有戰鬥的決心，反而很擅長逃亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另外......我們追蹤到了她進入塔拉王城舊址的痕跡。遺跡內的火熄滅了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成為感染者，或許讓她的源石技藝發生了變化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你似乎認為，是礦石病增強了她的力量？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵......當然不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是我的妹妹，要是連與我稍微抗衡的力量都沒有，那才實在是令人失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告訴我，她身邊有誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有幾個流民跟在她身邊，她在那些人面前堅持自稱領袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，你就不用跟著她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然她終於醒來，意識到自己作為德拉克的權能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那她很快就會回到我身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你確定能從這裡搭長途貨車？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是呀，我以前逃出維多利亞的時候就坐過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......風笛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你記不記得，我之前就問過你，你想要的真相是什麼，以及，知道之後你又想做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實這個結果，你早該知道。維多利亞的許多事情，最終大抵是這樣的權力鬥爭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，話是這樣說......可是每一件事裡，被捲進去的還是不一樣的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的想法還是沒有變，我必須把自己的報告書遞出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只不過，我在想，什麼時候維多利亞才會有一個地方能真正收下這份報告書？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我到底能用自己的雙手做些什麼，來讓維多利亞快些變成這樣的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "經歷了這麼多事，你還是想要改變維多利亞？你還真是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真什麼？真傻，還是真倔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真頑強。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這也是為什麼我們一直都是好朋友吧？認定的目標輕易不會改變，陳陳，我跟你，跟隊長，都是一樣的欸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈。從你嘴裡說出來，就不像誇我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，這些天其實我也一直在想......誰也不能說別人的夢想，是一定不能實現的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "收音機",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（無信號的嗞嗞聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還留著維恩塞給你的這東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不奇怪吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我來吧，這收音機已經夠舊了，我真怕在你手裡變成一堆廢鐵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "收音機",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......全體領民注意，維多利亞與卡茲戴爾在倫蒂尼姆周邊衝突不斷升級......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "收音機",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戰爭......嗞嗞......爆發......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "收音機",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "威靈頓公爵......嗞嗞......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "收音機",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請做好戰爭準備......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g1_victoriavillage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，我正在駕車返回，偵察任務已經完成，沒有發現異常動向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前那個身份所用的辦公室？返程後我會第一時間銷毀所有痕跡，請放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果沒有意外，我當然會接受公爵授予我的提拔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種事我並不打算隱瞞。到了那時，我個人的身份與面貌都會被拋棄掉，以現在的身份對你講什麼，都不重要吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下車走走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，先生，要木人嗎？我從河那邊的聚落帶來的，奶奶的手藝可精湛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好......請問，你是這附近的人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，感覺你看起來有點眼熟？真不好意思，我剛到這裡落腳，還沒認清這一帶的人呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我叫維恩，賣東西的。要是你有想買想賣的，都可以跟我說一聲，我順路給你帶上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我住在那邊，你看，昨天剛建好的屋子。離聚落是遠了一點，但在大路旁邊，我覺得不壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，這是你的車啊......我認錯人了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真不好意思，打擾您散心了，那您繼續——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "巨大的轟鳴聲讓兩個人同時轉過頭。\n龐大的影子浮現在地平線，他們腳下的地面不住顫抖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那個聲音是，什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不不，那是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......軍隊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......昨天，我在四百公里外完成了對這支部隊的偵察任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這是在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我始終相信，以強硬軍事手段著稱的鐵公爵，是我們最大的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在他的支持下，深池煽動民眾的仇恨，將無辜的普通人拖入暴亂甚至全面戰爭之中。我們必須找到與他制衡的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的每一次行動，都牽扯著成百上千的普通人的性命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是現在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他發現自己無法再發出聲音。\n轟隆。轟隆。\n高速戰艦率領的戰鬥集群行駛在它既定的航道上。\n這裡是開斯特公爵的領地。她默許了這一切發生，默許了戰爭借她的道路進發，碾過維多利亞的土地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......逃吧，塔拉人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的房子建錯了地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為、為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一帶仍然是開斯特公爵的領地，你們還沒越過那條模糊的邊界。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "經過這一段時間的周旋後，特倫特侯爵終究沒有倒向威靈頓公爵，並且，對塔拉人的管理會再度加壓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在這兩天，或許你就會重新遇見那些粗暴的巡邏隊，或許他們還沒有忘記你這張臉曾經出現在案宗裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是不是猜錯了公爵的意思？他會不會也成為這場戰爭中被犧牲的一枚棋子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們誰都無法回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......若是我們能知道答案，那孤獨的小屋就不會建在錯誤的位置了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，您在說什麼呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——等等，我想起來了，你、你是那個時候來抓我們的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你要幹什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "菲舍爾沒有回答，只是轉身上了車，啟動了引擎。\n在他身後，磚瓦小屋崩塌的聲音和鄉民悲痛的一聲叫喊，都被淹沒在高速戰艦的噪音裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
